---
// Experience, education & skills — departures board
---
<section id="experience" class="poster" aria-label="Experience, education and skills">
  <div class="band"><p class="band-label" data-i18n="xp.kicker">02 / EXPERIENCE — SYSTEM HISTORY</p></div>
  <div class="sheet">
    <h2 class="stops">
      <span>Story</span><span>Code</span><span>System</span><span>Security</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="rows">
      <article class="row job now">
        <p class="when" data-i18n="xp.j1.when">FEB 2026 — JUL 2026</p>
        <div class="body">
          <h4 data-i18n="xp.j1.role">Junior Developer · Security Engineering</h4>
          <p class="org">Overside Srl</p>
          <p data-i18n="xp.j1.desc">Development of Overguard, an email security platform against phishing and Business Email Compromise for SMBs: automated analysis of SMTP headers, sender, domain and URLs with IoC extraction and correlation; multi-signal risk scoring across 5 threat intelligence feeds to support event triage and escalation; rate limiting, verdict caching and source fallback for detection continuity, plus a semantic DLP module on outbound content. Backend in .NET 10 Clean Architecture, PostgreSQL, JWT-secured REST APIs, Docker deployment on Linux; Chrome MV3 and Thunderbird MV2 extensions integrated with the backend.</p>
          <p class="run-label" data-i18n="xp.stack">Stack</p>
          <ul class="run">
            <li>C#</li><li>.NET 10</li><li>ASP.NET Core</li><li>PostgreSQL</li><li>REST API</li>
            <li>JWT</li><li>Docker</li><li>Linux</li><li>Git</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="run-label" data-i18n="xp.detect">Detection &amp; feeds</p>
          <ul class="run strong">
            <li>Phishing &amp; BEC detection</li><li>Email analysis</li><li>IoC</li><li>Risk scoring</li>
            <li>DLP</li><li>VirusTotal</li><li>Google Safe Browsing</li><li>urlscan.io</li>
            <li>Hybrid Analysis</li><li>AlienVault OTX</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="row job">
        <p class="when" data-i18n="xp.j2.when">APR 2025 — JAN 2026</p>
        <div class="body">
          <h4 data-i18n="xp.j2.role">Junior Developer</h4>
          <p class="org">Levante Yachts Srl</p>
          <p data-i18n="xp.j2.desc">Automation of portal content publishing via REST APIs (WordPress, Google Sheets); MySQL database management with SQL queries for data verification and cleanup; frontend and backend development (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, PHP).</p>
          <ul class="run">
            <li>HTML</li><li>CSS</li><li>JavaScript</li><li>PHP</li><li>MySQL</li>
            <li>WordPress APIs</li><li>Google Sheets APIs</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-title" data-i18n="edu.title">Education &amp; Certifications</h3>
    <div class="rows">
      <article class="row edu">
        <p class="when" data-i18n="edu.e4.when">IN PROGRESS — 2026</p>
        <div class="body">
          <h4>CEH — Certified Ethical Hacker</h4>
          <p class="org">EC-Council</p>
          <p data-i18n="edu.e4.desc">Ethical hacking, penetration testing, vulnerability assessment, attack techniques, security controls.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="row edu">
        <p class="when">2024 — 2026</p>
        <div class="body">
          <h4>ITS Smart Academy</h4>
          <p class="org" data-i18n="edu.e1.sub">INDUSTRIAL SOFTWARE DEVELOPER<br>EQF LEVEL 5 · 110/110 CUM LAUDE</p>
          <p data-i18n="edu.e1.desc">Two-year higher technical program in industrial software development.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="row edu">
        <p class="when">2024</p>
        <div class="body">
          <h4>Università Politecnica delle Marche</h4>
          <p class="org">Cyber Risk &amp; Data Protection</p>
          <p data-i18n="edu.e2.desc">Cybersecurity, data protection, GDPR, software security, information security, cyber risk management.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="row edu">
        <p class="when">2024</p>
        <div class="body">
          <h4>Google Cybersecurity Certificate</h4>
          <p class="org">Foundations &amp; Operations</p>
          <p data-i18n="edu.e3.desc">Python, Linux, SQL, SIEM, IDS, risk assessment, threat identification, security controls.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-title" data-i18n="skills.title">Skills</h3>
    <div class="rows skills">
      <div class="row" role="group" aria-labelledby="sk-dev">
        <h4 id="sk-dev" data-i18n="skills.dev">Development</h4>
        <ul class="run">
          <li>C#</li><li>.NET 10</li><li>ASP.NET Core</li><li>Entity Framework</li><li>JavaScript</li>
          <li>PHP</li><li>Flutter</li><li>SQL</li><li>PostgreSQL</li><li>MySQL</li><li>Git</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="row" role="group" aria-labelledby="sk-cyber">
        <h4 id="sk-cyber" data-i18n="skills.cyber">Cybersecurity</h4>
        <ul class="run strong">
          <li>Phishing &amp; BEC detection</li><li>Email security</li><li>Threat intelligence</li>
          <li>IoC correlation</li><li>Risk scoring</li><li>Log analysis</li><li>Cyber risk</li>
          <li>Risk management</li><li>Data protection</li><li>DLP</li><li>Application security</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="row" role="group" aria-labelledby="sk-tools">
        <h4 id="sk-tools" data-i18n="skills.tools">Tools &amp; Infrastructure</h4>
        <ul class="run">
          <li>Linux</li><li>Bash</li><li>Docker</li><li>REST APIs</li><li>JWT</li><li>Semgrep</li><li>npm audit</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="row" role="group" aria-labelledby="sk-human">
        <h4 id="sk-human" data-i18n="skills.human">Human skills</h4>
        <ul class="run">
          <li>Critical thinking</li><li>Analytical thinking</li><li>Technical communication</li>
          <li>Problem solving</li><li>Client communication</li><li>Adaptability</li>
          <li>Attention to detail</li><li>Project management</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
